    <string name="about_application_title">I-app</string>
    <string name="about_description">I-Light yi-app yokubona amashejuli wokucima kwegesi e-Ukraine. Gcina ikhaya lakho, indawo yakho yokusebenzela nezinye iindawo ezibalulekileko ukuze ubone amashejuli wanamhlanje nawakusasa uhlele usuku lakho.</string>
    <string name="about_how_it_works_title">Isebenza njani</string>
    <string name="about_how_it_works_body">Engeza indawo: khetha isifunda sakho, umphakeli wegesi neqembu lokucima. Khetha ibizo nesithombe. Isikrini sekhaya sibonisa ishejuli enamangcenye wehora, uphawu lesikhathi samanje nesikhathi sesibuyekezo sokugcina. Wonke amashejuli asebenzisa isikhathi se-Kyiv.</string>
    <string name="about_reminders_title">Iinkhumbuzo</string>
    <string name="about_reminders_body">Endaweni ngayinye, khetha bona zingaphi iimizuzu ngaphambi kokucima kwegesi ofuna ukukhunjuzwa ngazo. Inketho ethi “Ungangikhathazi ebusuku” ithula iinkhumbuzo kusukela ngo-23:00 ukuya ku-07:00. Vumela iinsaziso kuiinkhetho ze-Android. Isikhathi sokufika sithembele emvumweni yesistimu nezithibelo zedivayisi.</string>
    <string name="about_widget_title">I-widget nokufinyelela ungakaxhunywa</string>
    <string name="about_widget_body">Engeza i-widget esikrinini sekhaya ukubona ishejuli ngaphandle kokuvula i-app uphindele phakathi kwanamhlanje nakusasa. Amashejuli alandiweko agcinwa kudivayisi yakho futhi atholakala ungaxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi. Kudingeka uxhumano lwe-inthanethi ukuthola ulwazi olusha.</string>
    <string name="about_sources_title">Imithombo yedatha</string>
    <string name="about_sources_body">I-app ilanda amashejuli abhaliweko ku-API ye-YASNO nakuzitoro ezivuliweko zedatha yokucima kwegesi. Ishejuli yakusasa ivela ngemva kokuthi umthombo ulibhale. Ukuphakama kwalo kuncike kuleyo mithombo, futhi idatha egciniweko ingaphelelwa yisikhathi. Ngesikhathi sokucima kwegesi kwesimo esiphuthumako, ugesi wangempela ungahluka eshejulini.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Ubumfihlo</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Iindawo ezigciniweko neenkhetho zigcinwa kudivayisi yakho kuphela. I-app isebenzisa i-Firebase ekuhlaziyeni ukusetjenziswa, imibiko yokuphuka kwe-app nemiyalezo yesevisi. Amabizo weendawo ezigciniweko awafakwa emicimbini yokuhlaziya nemibikweni yokuphuka kwe-app.</string>
